                                "example_id": "add29426-7be2-4b91-8b1f-b2820c70f855",
                                "sense_id": "a5318460-74b4-3beb-8977-7074753f40b4",
                                "text": "Another form of this kind of scepticism is as follows. Logic is apriori, but inductive \"logic\" is not, so it is not really logic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bde1b042-d09c-49bf-847b-d0355c1e9bad",
                                "sense_id": "a5318460-74b4-3beb-8977-7074753f40b4",
                                "text": "In other words, one can be fallibilist about both claims that are said to be apriori warranted and the a priori warrants for the claims."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
